Experimental source-owned startup plugin roots; not automatically applied by Context Foundry.
Target: can1357/oh-my-pi @ 24439066040e006eb08da7b204f0ac41c79d2de9
Owner: 003 T006 bounded-pilot-v2 startup observation and admission.
Requires prior caller/auth/refusal/restricted/catalog/settings/empty-auth/presence/telemetry/marketplace/logging patches.
Modules: discovery/helpers::{readPluginRoots,preloadPluginRoots,injectPluginDirRoots,clearClaudePluginRootsCache,clearPluginRootsAndCaches}; CLI and sdk exact-session binding.
Tests: startup-plugin-roots.test.ts plus existing plugin registry, SDK and CLI suites.
Difference: --startup-plugin-roots requires --restrict-tools; it retains original
reads, preloads and callbacks, bounds and drains them before atomic closure, rejects
late reads and cache clears, and fails on synchronous invalidator errors or reentry.
Ordinary behavior remains available without the flag. Other owners, complete
inventory, Ready, paid execution, signing and release acceptance remain open.

